    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11 15]\ntheorem green_26.variants.open :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime],\n      (∃ C, ∀ n, ∀ A : Fin C → Set (𝔽 p n), (∀ i, IsCube (A i)) →\n      ∑ i, A i = univ)",
